# Duty Beyond Death: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature. Creatures you control gain indestructible until
# end of turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control." Bot1 has two Memnites and sacrifices one: the other becomes a 2/2
# with one counter, and indestructible: Bot1's own Lightning Bolt kills Bot2's Memnite (1/1, no counter, not protected) while Bot2's
# Bolt on turn 3 does not kill Bot1's. On turn 4 the indestructible has ended: a Bolt kills Bot1's 2/2 Memnite.

